---
description: Red-green-refactor; failing test first; pytest exit gate
alwaysApply: true
---

# TDD

- No production code without a failing test first (red → green → refactor).
- Prefer pytest; stage exit requires green tests.
- Mirror source under `tests/unit/` and `tests/integration/`.
- Assert behavior and invariants; avoid trivial existence-only tests beyond Stage 0 smoke.
- When a stage fails, fix with TDD before advancing.
